  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1036/252/banner2.png\" alt=\"Banner\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.mangorage.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/834300742864601088?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=grey&color=green\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MangoRage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MangoRage&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/RealMangorage/TIAB-Curio-Support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/RealMangorage/TIAB-Curio-Support?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub Repo stars\"></a></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>使用代碼 MangoRage 購買任何商品可享 20% 折扣<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsodiumhosting.com%252fmangorage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://sodiumhosting.com/mangorage</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/time-in-a-bottle-universal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">瓶中時光</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/time-in-a-bottle-standalone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">瓶中時光獨立版</a> 提供 Curios 模組支援</li>\n<li>快捷鍵設定</li>\n<li>切換覆蓋層顯示</li>\n</ul>\n<p>覆蓋層</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/634/350/310/172/kt5fct5.png\" alt=\"Overlay\"></p>\n<p>Curios 槽位</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/634/355/310/172/npopzqi.png\" alt=\"Slot\"></p>\n<p>瓶裝物品放入槽位</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/634/356/310/172/oscacyf.png\" alt=\"Bottle in slot\"></p>\n<h2>使用方法</h2>\n<p>只需將瓶子放入 Curios 槽位即可！</p>\n<p>接著您可以按下 <code>g</code> 鍵使用瓶中時光物品，或按 <code>h</code> 鍵切換覆蓋層的顯示與隱藏。這些快捷鍵可在設定中重新綁定。</p>\n<p>您也可以使用指令 <code>/curiotiab configureOverlay</code> 來切換覆蓋層。</p>\n<h2>注意事項</h2>\n<p>目前僅支援 1.20.1 和 1.19.2 版本</p>\n<p>感謝您關注我的模組！我為此投入了大量心血。我計劃支援未來的 Minecraft 版本。我不會親自將其移植到 Fabric 上，但未來可能會改變主意。</p>\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<p>您可以透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.mangorage.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/RealMangorage/TIAB-Curio-Support/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a> 獲得支援</p>\n<p>請不要在此處發布關於問題的評論，請使用上述連結！</p>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<p>部分藝術素材由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/bananasplit50\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">bananasplit50</a> 製作</p>\n<p>說明文字由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimjustdoom.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JustDoom</a> 撰寫 ;)</p>",
